        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;Eligible immediate cancellations bypass operator review. Other eligible requests wait for an explicit decision.&#10;Cancellation and refund are separate outcomes. A paid order can be cancelled while its money still needs review (F22).&#10;Paid cancellations require the applicable refund process; recording cancellation alone does not return money." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
